      "writtenOn": "2025-06-13T23:56:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of passing a void * and a qos_class_type, just make two separate functions, one for CLIENT and one for EXPORT. The logic inside will be simpler and safer.",
      "revId": "110655858a554265dcda4558a55508a4c6297bd8",
